sequenceDiagram
  actor Cliente
  participant Frontend as Frontend PWA
  participant Backend as Fastify API
  participant BancoParceiro as Banco Parceiro (Pix Split)
  participant BullMQ as BullMQ Workers
  participant Bling as ERP Bling (NF-e)
  participant Correios as Correios (SRO/SIGEP)

  Cliente->>Frontend: Clica "Gerar QR Code Pix"
  Frontend->>Backend: POST /api/checkout/pix
  Backend->>BancoParceiro: POST /v1/pix/charges (splits: Portal 20%, Unicentro, Epyx 5%, ICMS)
  BancoParceiro-->>Backend: pixKey + qrCodeUrl + chargeId
  Backend-->>Frontend: Retorna QR Pix (expira em 15m)
  Cliente->>BancoParceiro: Paga Pix no app do banco
  BancoParceiro->>Backend: POST /api/webhooks/pix (HMAC SHA-256)
  Backend->>Backend: Valida timingSafeEqual + Order.status = PAID
  par Emissão Fiscal e Etiqueta
    Backend->>BullMQ: Enqueue erp-sync
    BullMQ->>Bling: Cria Pedido + Emite NF-e + Gera Etiqueta
    Bling->>Correios: Registra pré-postagem SIGEP (RR...PY)
  and Notificação Tempo Real
    Backend-->>Frontend: Atualiza status PAID + Redireciona Confirmação
  end
